-- English 5-letter answer list for Wordle
-- 2951 words
--
-- Two lists, as Wordle itself does it: this one holds words common enough to
-- be a fair answer, guesses_en.lua holds everything else the game will still
-- accept as a guess. Before this split there was one 716-word list doing both
-- jobs, so ordinary English guesses were rejected as "not a word".
--
-- Built from the intersection of ENABLE (Public Domain, see guesses_en.lua)
-- and SCOWL size 35 -- Copyright 2000-2018 Kevin Atkinson, used under SCOWL's
-- permission to use, copy, modify, distribute and sell these word lists and
-- the output created from them, provided this notice is kept. Obtained from
-- https://app.aspell.net/create. Plurals and third-person verb forms are
-- dropped (they make cheap answers), as are words unsuitable as a puzzle
-- answer; all of them remain valid guesses. The previously shipped list is
-- folded in unchanged.
--
-- 1.5.0 grew the list by about 640 hand-picked words that ENABLE accepts but
-- SCOWL 35 leaves out (FJORD, GECKO, KAZOO, LATTE, SUSHI, TAROT...), still
-- common words only, plus a few newer ones ENABLE predates (EMOJI, INBOX,
-- RAMEN, MANGA...) -- those are accepted as guesses by being answers.
